{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:625740e12e22b580","name":"Neutronium Reinforcement","source":{"id":"source:reference-625740e12e22b580","title":"Neutronium Reinforcement","revision":19719,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:29:18Z","sha256":"a237b7c5af32b8f00ef7bff1fa9066598247763c626cbbe85fcc280013c6b52a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19719","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Neutronium%20Reinforcement&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-625740e12e22b580","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Neutronium is a heavy, neutron-rich metallic alloy used to make armor and reinforce ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". It can also be used to harden and sharpen the striking or cutting surface of melee weapons other than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," given Neutronium Reinforcement gains +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," (maximum DR 15), 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", and +100% weight. A Slashing or Piercing melee weapon given Neutronium Reinforcement scores a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," on a natural roll of 19 or 20. (Only a Natural 20 is an automatic hit, however.)\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
